WEBVTT

00:01.910 --> 00:04.960
<b><i>Under the seven stars shining in the sky,</i></b>

00:05.210 --> 00:09.960
<b><i>a dreadful assassination art</i>
<i>lay hidden for 1,800 long years</i></b>

00:10.130 --> 00:12.590
<b><i>in the darkness of history.</i></b>

00:17.260 --> 00:21.770
<b><i>Living in history's shadows,</i>
<i>concealed in history's darkness,</i></b>

00:22.140 --> 00:24.770
<b><i>it's an art that moved through the ages.</i></b>

00:25.520 --> 00:26.730
<b><i>And its name is...</i></b>

02:00.780 --> 02:05.200
<b>A BETTER TOMORROW</b>

02:11.290 --> 02:14.050
<b>Yo, let's take a break.</b>

02:14.420 --> 02:16.880
<b>I'm so hungry, I can't move.</b>

02:17.720 --> 02:20.470
<b>Don't you have any more food?</b>

02:21.720 --> 02:24.140
<b>I gave you the last of it.</b>

02:24.520 --> 02:27.230
<b>Damn, if you say so.</b>

02:37.240 --> 02:39.700
<b><i>Crap, he noticed.</i></b>

02:43.950 --> 02:44.790
<b>Huh?</b>

02:48.710 --> 02:49.750
<b>What's that?</b>

02:51.290 --> 02:53.670
<b>Go, go, go!</b>

02:53.790 --> 02:56.340
<b>Come on, run!</b>

02:56.590 --> 03:00.010
<b>You better pick up the pace,
or we'll run you over!</b>

03:02.890 --> 03:05.510
<b>It's over, gramps!</b>

03:06.640 --> 03:11.560
<b>I need to get these rice seeds
back to the village!</b>

03:12.310 --> 03:13.770
<b>What?</b>

03:14.060 --> 03:16.730
<b>Once the grain is ready,</b>

03:16.980 --> 03:20.200
<b>we'll share the harvest with you.</b>

03:20.400 --> 03:22.740
<b>Please just wait until then.</b>

03:23.030 --> 03:26.120
<b>I searched a long time for these seeds,</b>

03:26.240 --> 03:30.080
<b>and I haven't eaten a thing
on my weeklong journey home.</b>

03:31.290 --> 03:34.670
<b>Now I wanna munch
on those seeds even more!</b>

03:34.880 --> 03:38.510
<b>Please, I'm begging you. Let me go.</b>

03:39.170 --> 03:42.890
<b>Hey, let's leave.
We should stay outta this.</b>

03:43.260 --> 03:44.350
<b>You idiot!</b>

03:51.480 --> 03:55.110
<b>You. What're you trying to pull?</b>

03:57.520 --> 03:59.400
<b>Hey, baldy.</b>

04:00.150 --> 04:01.900
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

04:02.530 --> 04:04.490
<b>Let the old man go.</b>

04:04.820 --> 04:08.330
<b>Can't you see I got a crossbow here?</b>

04:09.790 --> 04:10.960
<b>Stand down.</b>

04:11.830 --> 04:16.040
<b>Your arrows are just floating sticks
to my Hokuto Shinken.</b>

04:17.000 --> 04:20.010
<b>It's assassination art
passed through the generations.</b>

04:20.970 --> 04:22.630
<b>I'm a professional fighter.</b>

04:23.550 --> 04:24.890
<b>You can't kill me.</b>

04:25.220 --> 04:28.350
<b>What's that? The Hokuto Shinken?</b>

04:28.470 --> 04:31.140
<b>What a moron. Die!</b>

04:34.980 --> 04:38.520
<b>I'll give you another chance.
Aim carefully.</b>

04:40.650 --> 04:43.150
<b>If you miss, I'm taking your right eye.</b>

04:43.990 --> 04:45.030
<b>Shut up!</b>

04:48.370 --> 04:51.080
<b>Hokuto Shinken:
Two-Fingered Air Stopping Snatch.</b>

04:55.040 --> 04:56.880
<b>S... Spade!</b>

05:03.470 --> 05:04.880
<b>Dammit...</b>

05:06.930 --> 05:08.260
<b>Those guys are...</b>

05:10.560 --> 05:12.140
<b>The seeds...</b>

05:13.230 --> 05:16.400
<b>Please take them... to the village.</b>

05:18.480 --> 05:20.190
<b>Those guys are with King!</b>

05:20.690 --> 05:23.610
<b>The vicious gang
that controls this whole area.</b>

05:23.780 --> 05:25.530
<b>This isn't good.</b>

05:25.650 --> 05:28.280
<b>These are rice seeds.</b>

05:28.410 --> 05:30.330
<b>Yeah, we heard you.</b>

05:30.870 --> 05:34.250
<b>But why aren't you eating them?</b>

05:34.410 --> 05:36.670
<b>It's all for nothing if you die.</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:41.250
<b>No, our current rations
won't last forever.</b>

05:41.380 --> 05:42.960
<b>But...</b>

05:43.260 --> 05:47.470
<b>As long as we have these seeds,
we can grow rice.</b>

05:47.760 --> 05:51.600
<b>We can harvest more year after year.</b>

05:51.970 --> 05:56.480
<b>So that all of us, now and in the future,
can keep on living.</b>

05:56.600 --> 06:01.020
<b>Then no one
will need to steal food anymore.</b>

06:01.980 --> 06:04.280
<b>We can rid ourselves of fighting.</b>

06:06.150 --> 06:10.160
<b>Rather than today,
we must think of tomorrow.</b>

06:11.780 --> 06:16.410
<b>I searched high and low
for half a year,</b>

06:16.540 --> 06:18.620
<b>and this is all I managed to find.</b>

06:19.000 --> 06:20.790
<b>Please...</b>

06:21.630 --> 06:25.960
<b>Take this... to the village...</b>

06:33.470 --> 06:35.310
<b>What are you doing?</b>

06:35.600 --> 06:37.560
<b>You're not serious, are you?</b>

06:38.520 --> 06:42.650
<b>Come, mister. Let's go to your village.</b>

06:52.910 --> 06:55.040
<b>Come on, tell me why.</b>

06:55.200 --> 06:57.200
<b>Why're you doing all this?</b>

06:57.790 --> 07:02.670
<b>Don't you get it, Ken?
Those King guys are seriously bad news.</b>

07:03.250 --> 07:05.840
<b>They're not like those stupid bandits.</b>

07:06.670 --> 07:09.590
<b>They don't just loot food and water.</b>

07:09.800 --> 07:12.850
<b>They snatch people away
to make huge cities.</b>

07:13.680 --> 07:16.770
<b>And they call their boss "King."</b>

07:17.270 --> 07:20.140
<b>They say no one knows his real name.</b>

07:24.570 --> 07:28.690
<b>Oh, yeah. Why were you even
roaming around the wastelands?</b>

07:28.900 --> 07:31.240
<b>And you have that crazy martial art.</b>

07:31.950 --> 07:35.870
<b>Back at the village, you said
you're going "nowhere in particular."</b>

07:36.160 --> 07:37.660
<b>But that's bull, isn't it?</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:44.960
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

07:46.090 --> 07:49.970
<b>Where are you trying to go?
What's your end game here?</b>

07:57.680 --> 08:01.270
<b>Hey, you can tell me, can't you?</b>

08:01.390 --> 08:04.060
<b>Your cute little companion wants to know.</b>

08:07.860 --> 08:10.320
<b>So, that's how it is, huh?</b>

08:10.530 --> 08:14.620
<b>Man, what's going on
in that head of yours?</b>

08:15.620 --> 08:16.990
<b>And you know what?</b>

08:17.280 --> 08:22.960
<b>Picking a fight with King and
returning that gramps to his village...</b>

08:24.250 --> 08:29.170
<b>Why're you doing all this
for that raggedy old man anyway?</b>

08:29.380 --> 08:31.170
<b>I can't wrap my head around it.</b>

08:32.090 --> 08:34.640
<b>-We must think of tomorrow.
-Huh?</b>

08:35.640 --> 08:39.560
<b>I feel like he's the first human
I've met in a while.</b>

08:41.020 --> 08:42.270
<b>Human...</b>

08:46.270 --> 08:50.980
<b>This will rid us of fighting.</b>

08:58.620 --> 09:01.620
<b>Hey, we almost at the village yet?</b>

09:02.000 --> 09:04.290
<b>How long is this gonna take?</b>

09:04.580 --> 09:06.790
<b>I'm sorry</b>

09:07.040 --> 09:10.340
<b>for having you carry me the whole way.</b>

09:10.460 --> 09:13.760
<b>I really am sorry.</b>

09:14.550 --> 09:15.590
<b>It's fine.</b>

09:21.640 --> 09:22.980
<b>Spade...</b>

09:24.810 --> 09:26.310
<b>Unforgivable.</b>

09:27.230 --> 09:32.360
<b>I'm gonna massacre them!</b>

09:34.820 --> 09:38.200
<b>Oh! There it is!</b>

09:42.040 --> 09:42.910
<b>What's this?</b>

09:43.620 --> 09:45.620
<b>Isn't that Old Man Misumi?</b>

09:47.000 --> 09:50.340
<b>You're kidding! He found some?!</b>

09:51.130 --> 09:53.010
<b>I brought rice seeds!</b>

09:53.340 --> 09:56.550
<b>That old man really did it.</b>

09:56.760 --> 09:58.260
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

09:58.760 --> 10:01.640
<b>The old man did it! He's back!</b>

10:02.720 --> 10:04.600
<b>He found rice seeds?</b>

10:04.770 --> 10:08.770
<b>And he even got back
to the village safely!</b>

10:14.190 --> 10:15.740
<b>Hey!</b>

10:17.360 --> 10:19.700
<b>You did it, old man!</b>

10:19.820 --> 10:24.330
<b>The village is saved!
Now we don't have to worry about food!</b>

10:24.490 --> 10:27.460
<b>-Thank you!
-Old Man Misumi did it! Banzai!</b>

10:30.880 --> 10:35.170
<b>Thank you.</b>

10:37.010 --> 10:40.260
<b>I bet we're gonna get
a big reward for this.</b>

10:41.430 --> 10:44.680
<b>Right? Huh? Wait, what?</b>

10:44.930 --> 10:47.180
<b>You're leaving?!</b>

10:48.770 --> 10:52.560
<b>Spade. That man's leaving the village.</b>

10:56.280 --> 11:00.660
<b>All right! Let's get this started!</b>

11:01.620 --> 11:04.580
<b>What the hell are you thinking?</b>

11:04.950 --> 11:08.250
<b>Man, after all that...</b>

11:20.300 --> 11:21.970
<b>This is bad.</b>

11:22.220 --> 11:24.050
<b>They're back for revenge.</b>

11:24.470 --> 11:27.350
<b>That's why I told you not to get involved!</b>

11:39.950 --> 11:41.570
<b>The village!</b>

12:08.270 --> 12:10.600
<b>We found you, gramps!</b>

12:20.690 --> 12:23.450
<b>I have a request to make.</b>

12:24.110 --> 12:25.120
<b>Hmm?</b>

12:25.240 --> 12:28.450
<b>Please stop your attack on the village
right away.</b>

12:28.830 --> 12:33.750
<b>If these seeds grow, we can all survive.</b>

12:34.000 --> 12:35.670
<b>All of you, too.</b>

12:36.250 --> 12:38.170
<b>There's no point in fighting.</b>

12:38.300 --> 12:42.670
<b>The looting and killing can finally end.</b>

12:45.260 --> 12:48.640
<b>I couldn't care less!</b>

12:52.480 --> 12:55.520
<b>Not this. Anything but this.</b>

12:59.650 --> 13:03.610
<b>Rather than today,
we must think of tomorrow.</b>

13:03.900 --> 13:06.200
<b>Die, gramps!</b>

13:27.260 --> 13:28.010
<b>Tomorrow...</b>

13:29.180 --> 13:31.010
<b>Our tomorrow...</b>

13:33.600 --> 13:34.230
<b>Mister!</b>

13:34.940 --> 13:36.560
<b>You're here!</b>

13:36.900 --> 13:40.270
<b>I'm gonna send you to hell, too!</b>

13:41.900 --> 13:46.660
<b>You came back for us?</b>

13:48.070 --> 13:52.410
<b>It seems this is the end for me.</b>

13:52.660 --> 13:56.120
<b>But please, my one wish</b>

13:56.250 --> 13:59.580
<b>is for these rice seeds to grow.</b>

14:00.790 --> 14:05.590
<b>P... Please...</b>

14:13.890 --> 14:17.190
<b>He finally croaked!</b>

14:21.900 --> 14:27.860
<b>You bastards have no right to live today!</b>

14:35.080 --> 14:36.450
<b>Get him!</b>

14:43.380 --> 14:45.170
<b>This guy's...</b>

14:56.640 --> 15:00.020
<b>Jeez, what the hell is Ken thinking?</b>

15:02.110 --> 15:03.730
<b>What a mess.</b>

15:06.150 --> 15:10.740
<b>You fell right into my trap, you moron!</b>

15:11.030 --> 15:12.120
<b>Do it!</b>

15:20.580 --> 15:22.170
<b>We got him now!</b>

15:26.420 --> 15:30.510
<b>How's that? Now you can't move
your arms or legs.</b>

15:31.180 --> 15:32.470
<b>Like I said.</b>

15:32.890 --> 15:35.720
<b>You lowlifes can't kill me.</b>

15:36.140 --> 15:39.180
<b>I'll kill you
and splatter your brains everywhere!</b>

15:44.150 --> 15:45.270
<b>Oh, no!</b>

15:57.740 --> 16:00.620
<b>You're challenging me
to a battle of brawn?</b>

16:00.910 --> 16:03.000
<b>What a foolish brat.</b>

16:03.380 --> 16:09.090
<b>Humans can only use
30 percent of their hidden potential.</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:15.890
<b>Hokuto Shinken holds the secret
to using the remaining 70 percent.</b>

16:23.020 --> 16:25.610
<b>What? You can't be serious!</b>

16:34.280 --> 16:36.990
<b>Stone Mountain Splitting Slash!</b>

16:43.870 --> 16:45.500
<b>STONE MOUNTAIN SPLITTING SLASH</b>

16:50.460 --> 16:52.840
<b>You bastard!</b>

16:53.090 --> 16:56.970
<b>The hell are you all doing? Get him!</b>

17:00.890 --> 17:02.640
<b>We're gonna kill you!</b>

17:02.890 --> 17:04.390
<b>Die!</b>

17:36.050 --> 17:37.260
<b>Wow.</b>

17:37.800 --> 17:40.180
<b>He's taking out the King squad,
all on his own!</b>

17:42.100 --> 17:44.140
<b>Don't mess with me!</b>

17:49.610 --> 17:51.070
<b>What's wrong, baldy?</b>

17:52.480 --> 17:53.570
<b>Is that all you've got?</b>

18:16.380 --> 18:19.050
<b>Hokuto Fist of Penitence!</b>

18:21.300 --> 18:26.270
<b>This is Toi,
one of the 708 Hidden Channeling Points.</b>

18:27.140 --> 18:31.270
<b>When I release my thumb,
you'll die in three seconds.</b>

18:31.770 --> 18:33.610
<b>No way...</b>

18:33.900 --> 18:38.910
<b>Use those three seconds
to recognize the weight of your sins.</b>

18:39.200 --> 18:42.740
<b>Wait, please!</b>

18:47.750 --> 18:49.370
<b>No...</b>

18:49.790 --> 18:53.550
<b>I don't want to die yet!
I don't want to die!</b>

18:53.800 --> 18:54.800
<b>I don't--</b>

19:03.220 --> 19:04.680
<b>Run!</b>

19:17.280 --> 19:18.320
<b><i>Mister...</i></b>

19:19.200 --> 19:22.570
<b><i>Rather than today,</i>
<i>we must think of tomorrow.</i></b>

19:35.210 --> 19:37.260
<b>Hey, get a grip!</b>

19:37.380 --> 19:41.180
<b>We gotta hurry before backup gets here.</b>

19:42.050 --> 19:44.680
<b>King's not a half-assed gang.</b>

19:44.800 --> 19:48.390
<b>You're in for a rude awakening
if you think Spade's their leader.</b>

19:52.900 --> 19:55.980
<b>There's no way those will grow there.</b>

19:56.940 --> 19:57.860
<b>They'll grow.</b>

19:59.820 --> 20:03.740
<b>That elderly man is resting down below.</b>

20:33.310 --> 20:35.020
<b>Stop slacking!</b>

20:35.150 --> 20:36.980
<b>Keep those hands moving!</b>

20:39.400 --> 20:41.860
<b>Be grateful we aren't killing you,</b>

20:41.990 --> 20:43.570
<b>you pathetic bugs!</b>

20:46.200 --> 20:48.120
<b>Bad news! It's Spade!</b>

20:48.330 --> 20:49.950
<b>Spade was...</b>

20:58.040 --> 21:00.420
<b>King, bad news.</b>

21:00.550 --> 21:02.720
<b>They killed Spade!</b>

21:04.180 --> 21:05.590
<b>Spade?</b>

21:09.350 --> 21:12.680
<b>And you came running back here, did you?</b>

21:16.350 --> 21:17.190
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:17.520 --> 21:20.940
<b>-Please forgive us.
-King...</b>

21:31.410 --> 21:33.960
<b>Spare us...</b>

21:53.430 --> 21:55.390
<b>What now, King?</b>

21:55.600 --> 21:57.400
<b>Should we track them down?</b>

21:57.770 --> 21:59.810
<b>That won't be necessary.</b>

22:00.400 --> 22:04.570
<b>Sooner or later,
he'll be the one looking for us instead.</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:40.040
<b>SUBTITLE TRANSLATION BY CHUL KIM</b>
